  "prefLabel": "Puc 604.01 Records in General",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 604.01 Records in General. All records shall be organized, arranged, or prepared to ensure that sufficient data is available to determine the status of compliance with these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 600) #13887, eff 2-22-24",
